    "long_instructions": "## Update Array Values\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your `favoritesArray` from the previous level.\r\n\r\n2. Change at least 2 items in your array using reassignment:\r\n   favoritesArray[index] = \"new value\"\r\n\r\n3. Make sure you update your array **before** displaying the values on the page.\r\n\r\n4. Run your code and check your results:\r\n   * Did your updated items display correctly?\r\n   * What changed when you updated different index positions?",
